## Environments and deletion

Create each environment with `kupe_app_environment` and set its `app` to this resource's `name`. Terraform then creates the app before its environments and destroys the environments first.

Deletion protection is on by default for both resources. Set `deletion_protection = false` on the app and its environments, and apply, before you destroy them. The platform keeps an app while any environment remains, including one Terraform does not manage, and the provider never deletes environments it does not manage. Destroying an environment deletes its namespace and everything in it; the cluster and the Vault entries are kept.

